  "slug": "unpredictable-life",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/9889_unpredictable-life.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "",
    "Some people are lucky enough to have a seat as soon as they get on the bus. Some people are unlucky enough to remain standing even when everyone in the car is seated. Sometimes seats elsewhere keep becoming vacant, but the one next to me is silent. But when he made up his mind to go elsewhere, the person in the seat just left. Some people used various methods and waited for a long time before they could finally sit down, but by then they had already arrived at their station."
  ],
  "english_full": "\n\nSome people are lucky enough to have a seat as soon as they get on the bus. Some people are unlucky enough to remain standing even when everyone in the car is seated. Sometimes seats elsewhere keep becoming vacant, but the one next to me is silent. But when he made up his mind to go elsewhere, the person in the seat just left. Some people used various methods and waited for a long time before they could finally sit down, but by then they had already arrived at their station.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "",
    "Не́сколько лю́дей везу́чие, и́х хватает се́длать, как то́лько они сади́тся в авто́бус. Но не́сколько лю́дей неуда́чливы и оста́ются стоя́ть, даже когда все в автомоби́ле седа́ли. Времена́ми в других местах седа́лища ста́новятся вака́нтными, но то́чное, ря́дом со мной остаётся ти́хим. Но когда он реши́л уйти́ в друго́е место, чело́век, сидя́щий рядом, просто ушёл. Не́сколько лю́дей испо́льзовали ра́зные ме́тоды и ждали́ до́лгий вре́мя, прежде чем, в конце́ концо́в, они смогли сесть, но к тому вре́мени они уже́ прибыли́ на свою́ дислока́цию."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "",
    "Néskol'ko lyudéy vezúchie, íkh khvataet sédlat', kak tól'ko oni sadítsya v avtobús. No néskol'ko lyudéy neudáchlivy i ostáyutsya stoyát', dazhe kogdá vse v avtóbile sédal'. Vreménami v drugikh mestákh sédal'ishcha stánovyatsya vakán'tnymi, no tóchnoye, ryádom so mnóy ostayetsya tíkhím. No kogdá on reshil' uytí v drugóye mesto, chélovek, sidyáshchiy ryádom, prósto ushél. Néskol'ko lyudéy ispol'zóvali ráznye métody i zhDáli dólgiy vrémyá, prezhdE chem, v końtsé kóncov, oni smógli sél'sya, no k tomú vrémý oni úzhe príbilí na svoyú dislokátsiyu."
  ],
